1
00:00:00,280 --> 00:00:02,050
(Leonard:)Okay, that's all I got.

2
00:00:02,050 --> 00:00:04,300
(Leonard:)Howard, you're up.

3
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:07,810
(Howard:)Um... tell us about your work, Amy.

4
00:00:07,810 --> 00:00:09,510
(Amy:)I doubt you'd understand.

5
00:00:09,510 --> 00:00:12,260
(Amy:)Sheldon tells me you only
have a master's degree.

6
00:00:14,060 --> 00:00:16,650
(Howard:)Raj, do you have any
questions for Amy?

7
00:00:19,470 --> 00:00:23,060
(Amy:)I'm curious as to why
we're not eating alone.

8
00:00:23,060 --> 00:00:25,120
(Sheldon:)They can't function without me.

9
00:00:25,120 --> 00:00:29,980
(Sheldon:)I'm the social glue that holds
this little group together.

10
00:00:29,980 --> 00:00:31,450
(Sheldon:)You're welcome.

11
00:00:33,830 --> 00:00:36,700
(Leonard:)Listen, can I talk to you
about your girlfriend?

12
00:00:36,700 --> 00:00:38,500
(Sheldon:)She's not my girlfriend.

13
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:40,460
(Sheldon:)She's a girl and she's my friend,

14
00:00:40,460 --> 00:00:44,180
(Sheldon:)but there's no touching or
unsanitary exchange of saliva.

15
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:47,050
(Penny:)Got it.

16
00:00:47,050 --> 00:00:49,010
(Sheldon:)Although, for the record,
on one occasion,

17
00:00:49,020 --> 00:00:51,670
(Sheldon:)she licked her thumb to
remove raspberry jelly

18
00:00:51,670 --> 00:00:53,520
(Sheldon:)from the corner of my mouth.

19
00:00:53,520 --> 00:00:55,940
(Sheldon:)It's an action we both
regret to this day.

20
00:00:55,940 --> 00:00:57,020
(Leonard:)Uh-huh.

